1 NAME Batara Gowa Tumenanga ri Paralakkenna
2 GIVN Batara Gowa
2 NSFX Tumenanga ri Paralakkenna
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1475
1 TITL Sombayya ri Gowa VII
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1.	[33r] Batara Guru was the''' sibling''' of Tunabunoa '''Tolali, Ratu Sampo Marantaya, Karaeng Katangka.1'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.	'''Batara Gowa married''' a person from Garassiq. '''A child of Somba Garassiq''' he wed. They had a '''child Tunijalloq ri Passukkiq''' whose personal name was I Pakereq Tau. Another child was called Barataua whose karaeng-tit
2 CONC le was [32r] Karaeng ri Garassiq. Another child was a daughter called Karaeng ri Bone whose personal name is not known
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.	'''Karaeng Tunijalloq ri Passukkiq had no children'''. Karaeng ri Bone had no children either. Karaeng Barataua married a woman from Bila named Karaeng Maccillaka. They had children: Karaeng Botoroka; Karaeng Loaya; Karaeng ri 
2 CONC Taipaya who was also called Karaeng ri Balapapanga. Karaeng Botoroka had two sons:21 one named Karaeng Tomponga, one named Karaeng Maros. Karaeng Loaya had children: a daughter Karaeng Maros and Karaeng ri Patteqne. Karaeng ri Tai
2 CONC paya had children: I Daeng Bodo and the grandmother of I Jiya (I Kare Luqmuq). 
2 CONT
2 CONT [Batara Gowa’s] wife from Garassiq died. There was a karaeng, a lime trader, who came up22 here. He had a slave for sale named I Rerasi bought by I Juragang. He was asked for that person by Batara Gowa. She was given and slept wit
2 CONC h [by Batara Gowa]. They had children: '''Karaeng Tumapaqrisiq Kallonna'''; a daughter '''Karaeng Makeboka'''
2 CONT
2 CONT https://library.oapen.org/bitstream/handle/20.500.12657/34660/376974.pdf?sequence=1&isAllowed=y
2 CONT
