1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Raja Bharubhasa (Sultan Mahmud) (Raja Cermin) (Sultan Jiddah Ri'ayah Sa'adatus Salam). Raja Langkasuka c1335-1345. Raja Kelantan c1345-c1362.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Appoined as Raja of Chermin during the reign of his grandfaher. Became Raja of Lankasauka on the death of his father, 1339. Expanded his kingdom over a large area, taking-in parts other parts of the peninsular, including Perak and
2 CONC  Kedah, parts of nothern Sumatra and Champa in Vietnam. Defeated by the Siamese in 1345, forced to accept their suzerainty and pay tribute to Sukhothai. Converted to Islam and assumed the title of Sultan Mahmud Jiddah Riayath Sa'a
2 CONC dat us-Salam. Removed his court to Bukit Panau, where he established the new capital of Jiddah Riayath Sa'adat us-Salam ('jewel'). Submitted to Majapahit after Gajah Mada defeated the Siamese in 1357
