2 CONT =Maulana Yusuf Panembahan Pakalangan Gede=
2 CONT
2 CONT Memiliki putra/i:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Pg. Arya Upapati
2 CONT # Pg. Arya Adikara
2 CONT # Pg. Arya Mandalika
2 CONT # Pg. Arya Ranamanggala
2 CONT # Pg. Arya Seminingrat,
2 CONT # Pg. Manduraraja
2 CONT # Pg. Muhammad*
