2 CONT ==Relatives: ==
2 CONT * Son of (14th King of Luwu & Prince of Gowa )[https://www.geni.com/people/Abdullah-Khaidir-Gallarang-Moncong-Loe-Salamakar/6000000173091498949 Sultan Abdullah Khaidir] 
2 CONT *Husband of: Princess Karaeng Kontu; married his 1st cousin (fathers brothers daughter).
2 CONT * Nephew and son in law of [https://www.geni.com/people/Sultan-Alauddin/6000000173090310126 (14th King of Gowa) Sultan Alauddin]
2 CONT * Grandson of Emperor Tunijallo and Empress I-Sambo Daeng Niasseng of Makassar 
2 CONT * Uncle of Sultan Nabier (brothers son) [https://www.geni.com/people/Sultan-Nabier/6000000173073775924 (29th King) Sultan Nabier Nabier]
2 CONT
