2 CONT * 1665	Marriage of Yusuf al Makassari Salamakar and Ratu Ayu / Siti K...Serang, Serang, Banten, Indonesia
2 CONT * 1666	Birth of Ratu Bagus (Tubagus) Malolowa
2 CONT * Serang, Banten, Indonesia
2 CONT * 18th NOV 1667	the Treaty of Bongaya (1967)
2 CONT * Gowa Regency, South Sulawesi, Indonesia
2 CONT * 1684	Yusuf is captured and imprisoned by the Dutch, Jakarta, Indonesia
2 CONT * 27th JUN 1693	Yusuf is exiled from Indonesia to South Africa
2 CONT * Cape Town, Cape Town, WC, South Africa
2 CONT * 2nd APR 1694	Sheikh Yusuf and family arrive in South Africa, Cape Town, WC, South Africa
2 CONT * 23rd MAY 1699	Death of Sheikh Yusuf, Cape Town, Cape Town, Western Cape, South Africa
2 CONT * 1699	Sheik Yusuf's Kramat (Shrine) Cape Town, WC, South Africa
2 CONT * 1699	Zandvliet is renamed Macassar in honour of Sheikh Yusuf, Cape Town, WC, South Africa
