2 CONT Note on 5 November 2010/em:
2 CONT Link to her profile in Joyce Tree:
2 CONT http://www.geni.com/people/Sunyalarang-Ratu/6000000003010862281
2 CONT =============================================
2 CONT Note on 4 August 2010/em:
2 CONT Merge with profile in Vishnu path: Ratu Sunyalarang.
2 CONT =============================================
2 CONT Ratu Talaga abt 1500 - 1550.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT As the only daughter, she succeeded her father, Sunan Parung (King of Parung) and married with Prabu Siliwangi's descendant, Raden Rangga Mantri or otherwise known as Prabu Pucuk Unum. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Islam was gaining foothold and spreading fast. Her people became Moslems that the Queen and also her father in law (Prabu Pucuk Unum) also reportedly became Moslems.
2 CONT
2 CONT Islam spread and influenced her territory, including Maja, Rajagaluh and Majalengka. Prabu Pucuk Umum is the second Talaga King that converted to Islam. The relations between Talaga with Cirebok and Pajajaran Kingdoms were good. P
2 CONC rabu Pucuk Unum is the grandson of Prabu Siliwangi from Raden Munding Sari Ageng. So the marriage between Prabu Pucuk Umum and Ratu Sunyalarang is a family marriage in the 4th degree.   
2 CONT
2 CONT Most noted is that during her reign, Talaga became a trade hub of the South.
