1 NAME Sheikh Abdul Malik (Tok Ku Pulau Manis) /Bin Sharif Abdullah/
2 GIVN Sheikh Abdul Malik (Tok Ku Pulau Manis)
2 _MARNM Bin Sharif Abdullah
1 NAME Dato' Syarif 'Abdul Malik (Tok Ku Pulau Manis)
1 SEX M
