1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT See:  "God's Slave & Afrikaner 'Hearts of Darkness' - Abdullah alias Adolf Jonker (c. 1709-1779)" by Mansell Upham - published on the website of The First Fifty Years project. http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/RemarkableWriting/UL28_J
2 CONC onker.pdf & borne out by http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/RemarkableWriting/JonkerDNA.pdf
