1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Raja Ahmad. Raja Kelantan c1527-c1547.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT a) Raja Ahmad ibni al-Marhum Raja Muhammad, Raja of Trengganu. m. (first) Raja Kamala Dewi binti al-Marhum Sultan Mahmud Shah, daughter of Paduka Sri Sultan Mahmud Shah I ibni al-Marhum Sultan 'Ala'uddin Ri'ayat Shah Shah, Sultan 
2 CONC of Malacca and of Johor. m. (second) Raja Puspa Dewi binti al-Marhum Sultan Mansur Shah, elder daughter of Sultan Mansur Shah ibni al-Marhum Sultan 'Abdu'l Jalil Shah, Sultan of Pahang. He had issue, a son and a daughter:
2 CONT
2 CONT i) Raja Umar bin Raja Ahmad, Raja of Kelantan in 1565, who later succeeded as Paduka Sri Sultan Ali Jalla 'Abdu'l Jalil Shah II ibni al-Marhum Raja Ahmad, Sultan of Johor (s/o Raja Puspa Dewi) - see below and Malaysia (Malacca-Joh
2 CONC or). i) Putri Bakal binti al-Marhum Raja Ahmad. m. as his second wife, Sultan Mansur Shah II ibni al-Marhum Sultan Zainal-Abidin Shah, Sultan of Pahang (k. 1560), elder son of Sultan Zainal-Abidin Shah ibni al-Marhum Sultan Mahmud
2 CONC  Shah, Sultan of Pahang, by his wife, Raja Dewi binti al-Marhum Sultan Mahmud Shah, daughter of Paduka Sri Sultan Mahmud Shah I ibni al-Marhum Sultan 'Ala'uddin Shah, Sultan of Malacca and Johor. She had issue, two sons and two da
2 CONC ughters - see Malaysia (Pahang).
